    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outwit. Outshoot. Outlive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Quill &gt; Pistol</u></i></strong> is a turn-based dueling game where <strong>logic is your weapon</strong> \u2014 and the only thing standing between you and death.<br>Play as <strong>The Mathematician</strong>, a scholar dragged from the quiet halls of academia into a brutal underground pistol dueling tournament, where cold reasoning meets hot lead\u2026 and one mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each duel is a puzzle.<br>Each opponent, a nightmare.<br>Face twisted inventors, occult marksmen, and brilliant killers as you unravel the secrets behind the tournament\u2019s blood-stained origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your mind save you?<br>Or will you become another name in the ledger of the dead?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Solve unique logic-based mini-games</strong> to prepare your shot<br>\ud83c\udccf <strong>Earn skill cards</strong> to manipulate the odds<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Face a gallery of deadly opponents</strong>, each with unique tactics and mind games<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Uncover a stylish, cerebral narrative</strong> filled with wit, duels, and dread<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Engage in turn-based combat</strong> where every decision is a matter of life and death</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outwit. Outshoot. Outlive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Quill &gt; Pistol</u></i></strong> is a turn-based dueling game where <strong>logic is your weapon</strong> \u2014 and the only thing standing between you and death.<br>Play as <strong>The Mathematician</strong>, a scholar dragged from the quiet halls of academia into a brutal underground pistol dueling tournament, where cold reasoning meets hot lead\u2026 and one mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each duel is a puzzle.<br>Each opponent, a nightmare.<br>Face twisted inventors, occult marksmen, and brilliant killers as you unravel the secrets behind the tournament\u2019s blood-stained origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your mind save you?<br>Or will you become another name in the ledger of the dead?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Solve unique logic-based mini-games</strong> to prepare your shot<br>\ud83c\udccf <strong>Earn skill cards</strong> to manipulate the odds<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Face a gallery of deadly opponents</strong>, each with unique tactics and mind games<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Uncover a stylish, cerebral narrative</strong> filled with wit, duels, and dread<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Engage in turn-based combat</strong> where every decision is a matter of life and death</p>",
